      <activity id="51f2b72b-d7c2-55aa-b782-13560383f027" activityNameId="a26faf48-41dd-569c-b30d-47cd430dd9ee" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Resource correction, PbZn, zinc, negative</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Resource correction, PbZn, zinc, negative
This dataset is designed to adjust resource demand in multi-output processes with mixed allocation schemes for resources (physical) and others (economical). In cases where the the upstream concentrate-inventory is allocated by economic criterias, the resouce demand of the individual refernece flos does not reflect the physical reality. Therefore the resource allocation is adjusted using this dataset in a way, that the resource demand of the specific reference flows from the multi-output process reflect the effective material composition .;
